# Archaeological Ceramic Analysis

This project analyzes a ceramic assemblage from archaeological excavations in Guachicono, Cauca.

The dashboard was built using Streamlit and allows interactive exploration of:

- Ceramic distribution by grid
- Fragment types
- Vessel types
- Thickness distribution
- Temper size analysis

## Tools
- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Streamlit

## Run the project

```bash
streamlit run app.py